    "Id": "mechdef_haze_HAZ-D",
    "Name": "Haze D",
    "Details": "The D configuration of the Haze OmniMech is its punishment configuration, often seen as an insult by Haze pilots because it was designed to compensate for MechWarriors with bad gunnery skills. Its three Medium Pulse Lasers are easier to keep on target, and its Streak SRM-6 only fires with a solid lock. A Nova CEWS completes the loadout. Like every Haze, it is usually stationed alongside ProtoMech forces to allow for rapid deployment and battlefield control.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Sensors</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.05</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "Haze"
  },
